   "source": [
    "## 3. Create Normalized Tables <a id='create'></a>\n",
    "\n",
    "We extract **customers**, **products**, and **orders** tables from the raw data using `SELECT DISTINCT`.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "id": "2ca61873",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "✅ customers table created dynamically.\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# ── CUSTOMERS TABLE ──\n",
    "conn.execute(\"\"\"\n",
    "    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS customers AS\n",
    "    SELECT DISTINCT\n",
    "        [Customer ID]   AS customer_id,\n",
    "        [Customer Name] AS customer_name,\n",
    "        [Segment]       AS segment,\n",
    "        [City]          AS city,\n",
    "        [State]         AS state,\n",
    "        [Region]        AS region\n",
    "    FROM superstore_raw\n",
    "\"\"\")\n",
    "\n",
    "count = pd.read_sql(\"SELECT COUNT(*) AS cnt FROM customers\", conn)\n",
    "print(\"✅ customers table created —\", count['cnt'][0], \"records\")\n",
    "pd.read_sql(\"SELECT * FROM customers LIMIT 5\", conn)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 11,
   "id": "683be437",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "✅ products table created dynamically.\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# ── PRODUCTS TABLE ──\n",
    "conn.execute(\"\"\"\n",
    "    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS products AS\n",
    "    SELECT DISTINCT\n",
    "        [Product ID]    AS product_id,\n",
    "        [Product Name]  AS product_name,\n",
    "        [Category]      AS category,\n",
    "        [Sub-Category]  AS sub_category\n",
    "    FROM superstore_raw\n",
    "\"\"\")\n",
    "\n",
    "count = pd.read_sql(\"SELECT COUNT(*) AS cnt FROM products\", conn)\n",
    "print(\"✅ products table created —\", count['cnt'][0], \"records\")\n",
    "pd.read_sql(\"SELECT * FROM products LIMIT 5\", conn)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 12,
   "id": "bd589d67",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "✅ orders table created dynamically.\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# ── ORDERS TABLE ──\n",
    "conn.execute(\"\"\"\n",
    "    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS orders AS\n",
    "    SELECT DISTINCT\n",
    "        [Row ID]        AS row_id,\n",
    "        [Order ID]      AS order_id,\n",
    "        [Order Date]    AS order_date,\n",
    "        [Ship Date]     AS ship_date,\n",
    "        [Ship Mode]     AS ship_mode,\n",
    "        [Customer ID]   AS customer_id,\n",
    "        [Product ID]    AS product_id,\n",
    "        CAST(Sales      AS REAL) AS sales,\n",
    "        CAST(Quantity   AS INTEGER) AS quantity,\n",
    "        CAST(Discount   AS REAL) AS discount,\n",
    "        CAST(Profit     AS REAL) AS profit\n",
    "    FROM superstore_raw\n",
    "\"\"\")\n",
    "\n",
    "count = pd.read_sql(\"SELECT COUNT(*) AS cnt FROM orders\", conn)\n",
    "print(\"✅ orders table created —\", count['cnt'][0], \"records\")\n",
    "pd.read_sql(\"SELECT * FROM orders LIMIT 5\", conn)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ab90830f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Subqueries | CTE | Window Function <a id='subqueries'></a>\n",
    "\n",
    "### 4.1 Orders with Above-Average Sales\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 13,
   "id": "76ea0e82",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Orders where sales > average sales across all orders\n",
    "query = \"\"\"\n",
    "    SELECT order_id, customer_id, product_id, ROUND(sales, 2) AS sales\n",
    "    FROM orders\n",
    "    WHERE sales > (\n",
    "        SELECT AVG(sales) FROM orders\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    ORDER BY sales DESC\n",
    "    LIMIT 10\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "result = pd.read_sql(query, conn)\n",
    "print(\"[System Log] Processing above-average sales rows...\")\n",
    "display(result)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "be2dc42b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.2 Highest Sales Order per Customer"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 15,
   "id": "afa7d30a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# For each customer, get the order with their highest single-order sales\n",
    "query = \"\"\"\n",
    "    SELECT o.customer_id, c.customer_name, o.order_id, ROUND(o.sales, 2) AS max_order_sales\n",
    "    FROM orders o\n",
    "    JOIN customers c ON o.customer_id = c.customer_id\n",
    "    WHERE o.sales = (\n",
    "        SELECT MAX(o2.sales)\n",
    "        FROM orders o2\n",
    "        WHERE o2.customer_id = o.customer_id\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    ORDER BY max_order_sales DESC\n",
    "    LIMIT 10\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "display(pd.read_sql(query, conn))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "69d987ef-b823-4b28-bd1f-67139b50d2f9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.3 Total sales per customer "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 20,
   "id": "d4c20419-f43c-488c-a091-9300b2597381",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "query = \"\"\"\n",
    "    WITH customer_sales AS (\n",
    "        SELECT\n",
    "            o.customer_id,\n",
    "            c.customer_name,\n",
    "            c.segment,\n",
    "            c.region,\n",
    "            ROUND(SUM(o.sales), 2)   AS total_sales,\n",
    "            ROUND(SUM(o.profit), 2)  AS total_profit,\n",
    "            COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id) AS total_orders\n",
    "        FROM orders o\n",
    "        JOIN customers c ON o.customer_id = c.customer_id\n",
    "        GROUP BY o.customer_id, c.customer_name, c.segment, c.region\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    SELECT *\n",
    "    FROM customer_sales\n",
    "    ORDER BY total_sales DESC\n",
    "    LIMIT 10\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "display(pd.read_sql(query, conn))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "45f5beff",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.4 Customers Who Spent More Than Average Total Sales"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 16,
   "id": "80513e0f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "query = \"\"\"\n",
    "    SELECT customer_id, ROUND(total_sales, 2) AS total_sales\n",
    "    FROM (\n",
    "        SELECT customer_id, SUM(sales) AS total_sales\n",
    "        FROM orders\n",
    "        GROUP BY customer_id\n",
    "    ) AS customer_totals\n",
    "    WHERE total_sales > (\n",
    "        SELECT AVG(total_sales)\n",
    "        FROM (\n",
    "            SELECT customer_id, SUM(sales) AS total_sales\n",
    "            FROM orders\n",
    "            GROUP BY customer_id\n",
    "        )\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    ORDER BY total_sales DESC\n",
    "    LIMIT 10\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "result = pd.read_sql(query, conn)\n",
    "display(result)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3e8ce2dd-cd64-49e2-9d85-b9a3f0596bb0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.5 Rank - Rank Customers based on Total Sales"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 21,
   "id": "fd7e70a0-9d1a-40e2-a10c-d28a834a1fdf",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "query = \"\"\"\n",
    "    WITH customer_sales AS (\n",
    "        SELECT\n",
    "            customer_id,\n",
    "            ROUND(SUM(sales), 2) AS total_sales\n",
    "        FROM orders\n",
    "        GROUP BY customer_id\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    SELECT\n",
    "        customer_id,\n",
    "        total_sales,\n",
    "        RANK()       OVER (ORDER BY total_sales DESC) AS rank,\n",
    "        DENSE_RANK() OVER (ORDER BY total_sales DESC) AS dense_rank\n",
    "    FROM customer_sales\n",
    "    ORDER BY rank\n",
    "    LIMIT 15\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "display(pd.read_sql(query, conn))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3f60ee02-3271-4e4c-8358-51c015e198bb",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.6 ROW_NUMBER — Rank Orders by Sales per Customer"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 22,
   "id": "1b7d61fb-2cde-46f2-85a2-222b476497a0",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "query = \"\"\"\n",
    "    SELECT\n",
    "        customer_id,\n",
    "        order_id,\n",
    "        ROUND(sales, 2) AS sales,\n",
    "        ROW_NUMBER() OVER (\n",
    "            PARTITION BY customer_id\n",
    "            ORDER BY sales DESC\n",
    "        ) AS sales_rank_per_customer\n",
    "    FROM orders\n",
    "    ORDER BY customer_id, sales_rank_per_customer\n",
    "    LIMIT 15\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "display(pd.read_sql(query, conn))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d545ec83-7fd2-427c-9a49-ca0fdf8c5dda",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.7 Top 3 Customers by Total Sales"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 23,
   "id": "241fe782-201f-49ec-9195-9c8a84700b7e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "query = \"\"\"\n",
    "    WITH customer_sales AS (\n",
    "        SELECT o.customer_id, c.customer_name, c.segment,\n",
    "               ROUND(SUM(o.sales), 2) AS total_sales,\n",
    "               ROUND(SUM(o.profit), 2) AS total_profit\n",
    "        FROM orders o\n",
    "        JOIN customers c ON o.customer_id = c.customer_id\n",
    "        GROUP BY o.customer_id, c.customer_name, c.segment\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    SELECT customer_name, segment, total_sales, total_profit,\n",
    "           RANK() OVER (ORDER BY total_sales DESC) AS rank\n",
    "    FROM customer_sales\n",
    "    LIMIT 3\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "display(pd.read_sql(query, conn))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0b6ddd5a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Final Combined Query <a id='subqueries'></a>\n",
    "\n",
    "### 5.1 This query gives **Customer Name, Total Sales, and their Sales Rank** in one shot."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 31,
   "id": "6feddc10",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "query = \"\"\"\n",
    "WITH customer_sales AS (\n",
    "    SELECT\n",
    "        o.customer_id,\n",
    "        ROUND(SUM(o.sales), 2) AS total_sales\n",
    "    FROM orders o\n",
    "    GROUP BY o.customer_id\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "SELECT\n",
    "    c.customer_name,\n",
    "    cs.total_sales,\n",
    "    RANK() OVER (ORDER BY cs.total_sales DESC) AS rank\n",
    "FROM customer_sales cs\n",
    "JOIN customers c\n",
    "    ON cs.customer_id = c.customer_id\n",
    "ORDER BY rank;\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "display(pd.read_sql(query, conn))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "74d9d311-4779-43d1-b977-15655196e915",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## MINI PROJECT : Customers Sales Insights <a id='subqueries'></a>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d50142f2-3cc8-4121-a586-2ee2fc044ee9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 6.1 Top 5 Customers (Top Sales)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 33,
   "id": "10e6f1fb-9a83-41c5-bef3-2315f349532f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "query = \"\"\"\n",
    "WITH customer_sales AS (\n",
    "    SELECT\n",
    "        customer_id,\n",
    "        ROUND(SUM(sales), 2) AS total_sales\n",
    "    FROM orders\n",
    "    GROUP BY customer_id\n",
    "),\n",
    "customer_info AS (\n",
    "    SELECT DISTINCT\n",
    "        customer_id,\n",
    "        customer_name\n",
    "    FROM customers\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "SELECT\n",
    "    ci.customer_name,\n",
    "    cs.total_sales,\n",
    "    RANK() OVER (ORDER BY cs.total_sales DESC) AS rank\n",
    "FROM customer_sales cs\n",
    "JOIN customer_info ci\n",
    "    ON cs.customer_id = ci.customer_id\n",
    "ORDER BY rank\n",
    "LIMIT 5;\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "display(pd.read_sql(query, conn))\n   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a6f6eec8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 6.2 Bottom 5 Customers (Lowest Sales)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 34,
   "id": "d04aed73",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "query = \"\"\"\n",
    "    WITH customer_sales AS (\n",
    "        SELECT o.customer_id, c.customer_name, c.segment,\n",
    "               ROUND(SUM(o.sales), 2) AS total_sales\n",
    "        FROM orders o\n",
